# Release the power-handler screen blank before a real suspend begins.
#
# The blank is a compositor state that survives suspend, so resuming with it
# still held restores brightness onto a panel that is switched off: the device
# looks dead and only ssh gets it back. The handler itself refuses to suspend
# while blanked, but a suspend from the ES menu or from systemd does not go
# through it. Runs before the other pre hooks so they see a normal display.

HANDLER="/usr/lib/autostart/quirks/platforms/SM8550/bin/power-handler"
[ -x "${HANDLER}" ] && "${HANDLER}" release

exit 0
